cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "formulaci: a test suite for human knowledge"
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Balaram
    given-names: Mahesh
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Machine verification of the formulas people rely on. Runs every <math> identity in
  English Wikipedia's mathematics, physics, statistics and engineering articles through
  SymPy/mpmath with inferred domains and constraints, reviews every flag, and reports
  confirmed errors with reproducible counterexamples. Builds on Greiner-Petter et al.,
  "Do the Math: Making Mathematics in Wikipedia Computable" (IEEE TPAMI, 2022).
